        "original_id": "b9d73859-330f-58d5-bbbe-fd273c96ca69",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pietro de' Medici, Cosimo I de' Medici, Eleonora di Toledo\n- Roles: Duke of Florence, Grand Duke of Tuscany\n\nFacts:\n- Cosimo I de' Medici was born on 12 June 1519 and died on 21 April 1574.\n- Cosimo I de' Medici was the second Duke of Florence from 1537 until 1569.\n- In 1569, Cosimo I de' Medici became the first Grand Duke of Tuscany.\n- Pietro de' Medici was born on 3 June 1554 and died on 25 April 1604.\n- Pietro de' Medici was the youngest son of Cosimo I de' Medici, Grand Duke of Tuscany, and Eleonora di Toledo.",
